{"id":"workflow-fit","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-01","context_id":"concept-three-control-modes","question":"什么任务优先使用确定性 workflow？","aliases":["简单流程也需要Agent吗"],"keywords":["确定性workflow","简单流程","Agent"],"diagnostic":"检查步骤是否已知且稳定。","hints":["查看 #concept-three-control-modes。","自由度越少越可控。"],"example":"授权→检索→回答。","answer":"步骤和分支事先已知的稳定流程优先workflow，不需要开放循环。","source":{"label":"三种控制模式","href":"#concept-three-control-modes"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"router-fit","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-01","context_id":"concept-three-control-modes","question":"路由器与 Agent 的核心区别是什么？","aliases":["什么时候用router不用agent"],"keywords":["路由器","Agent","router"],"diagnostic":"检查选择是一次白名单分支还是多步循环。","hints":["查看 #concept-three-control-modes。","路由器选择已注册分支。"],"example":"diagnostic→registered tool。","answer":"路由器通常只从白名单分支做一次受限选择；Agent会在有界循环中多次选择。","source":{"label":"三种控制模式","href":"#concept-three-control-modes"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"agent-fit","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-01","context_id":"concept-three-control-modes","question":"什么情况下才值得使用开放 Agent 循环？","aliases":["Agent自由度应该给什么任务"],"keywords":["开放Agent循环","自由度","任务"],"diagnostic":"检查步骤是否无法预先枚举。","hints":["查看 #concept-three-control-modes。","仍需预算和终态。"],"example":"多步调查。","answer":"只有步骤确实无法事先确定、需要根据中间结果调整时才用，并设置动作、步数和终态边界。","source":{"label":"三种控制模式","href":"#concept-three-control-modes"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"transition-owner","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-01","context_id":"concept-state-transition-owner","question":"谁拥有 Agent 状态迁移权？","aliases":["模型能直接写run状态吗"],"keywords":["状态迁移权","模型","run状态"],"diagnostic":"检查选择是否经应用映射。","hints":["查看 #concept-state-transition-owner。","模型只提出数据。"],"example":"inspect建议→应用校验transition。","answer":"应用拥有迁移权；模型只输出受Schema约束的选择，由代码校验当前状态和目标。","source":{"label":"状态迁移权","href":"#concept-state-transition-owner"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"explicit-terminals","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-01","context_id":"concept-state-transition-owner","question":"本课定义了哪些显式终态？","aliases":["Agent运行怎样保证一定结束"],"keywords":["显式终态","Agent运行","结束"],"diagnostic":"检查四类终态和预算。","hints":["查看 #concept-state-transition-owner。","每个run必须有terminal。"],"example":"completed/refused/failed/budget_exhausted。","answer":"completed、refused、failed和budget_exhausted；最大步数保证循环能停止。","source":{"label":"状态迁移权","href":"#concept-state-transition-owner"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"default-deny","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-01","context_id":"example-one-request-three-modes","question":"未知动作在流水线哪里拒绝？","aliases":["能先检索再检查动作权限吗"],"keywords":["未知动作","拒绝","检索","动作权限"],"diagnostic":"检查授权是否在retrieved之前。","hints":["查看 #example-one-request-three-modes。","默认拒绝。"],"example":"authorize→refused。","answer":"在检索和工具选择之前拒绝，避免无权内容进入候选或后续上下文。","source":{"label":"三条路线","href":"#example-one-request-three-modes"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"empty-evidence","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-01","context_id":"example-one-request-three-modes","question":"Agent 模式没有证据时能继续探索吗？","aliases":["开放循环能绕过证据门槛吗"],"keywords":["Agent模式","没有证据","开放循环","证据门槛"],"diagnostic":"检查所有模式的共同拒答条件。","hints":["查看 #example-one-request-three-modes。","模式不改变授权。"],"example":"evidence:[]→refused。","answer":"不能；没有证据就进入refused，Agent自由度不能绕过共同安全门槛。","source":{"label":"三条路线","href":"#example-one-request-three-modes"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"needs-input","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-01","context_id":"modify-add-clarification-state","question":"什么时候应该进入 needs_input？","aliases":["所有模糊问题都要问用户吗"],"keywords":["needs_input","模糊问题","用户"],"diagnostic":"检查缺失字段是否会改变路线。","hints":["查看 #modify-add-clarification-state。","只问真正阻塞的信息。"],"example":"缺少目标资源ID。","answer":"仅当缺少的信息会实质改变执行路线且无法安全推断时进入，并保存缺少字段。","source":{"label":"增加澄清状态","href":"#modify-add-clarification-state"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"stuck-run","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-01","context_id":"troubleshoot-orchestration-boundaries","question":"Agent run 一直不结束先检查什么？","aliases":["开放循环卡住怎么排查"],"keywords":["Agent run","不结束","开放循环","排查"],"diagnostic":"检查终态和最大步数。","hints":["查看 #troubleshoot-orchestration-boundaries。","运行必须有预算。"],"example":"max_steps=6。","answer":"先检查是否为每条分支定义终态，并在transition层执行最大步数预算。","source":{"label":"编排边界排错","href":"#troubleshoot-orchestration-boundaries"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"framework-boundary","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-01","context_id":"deepen-framework-mapping","question":"为什么不先从 LangGraph API 开始学编排？","aliases":["框架能替我定义Agent语义吗"],"keywords":["LangGraph","API","编排","Agent语义"],"diagnostic":"检查状态不变量是否独立于框架。","hints":["查看 #deepen-framework-mapping。","先理解node和edge语义。"],"example":"自建图测试后再映射。","answer":"框架提供机制但不定义授权、预算、终态和幂等；先掌握不变量才能判断映射是否正确。","source":{"label":"框架映射","href":"#deepen-framework-mapping"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"trace-no-cot","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-01","context_id":"project-learning-assistant-v31","question":"状态 trace 应保存什么而不保存什么？","aliases":["Agent trace需要记录思维链吗"],"keywords":["状态trace","保存","思维链"],"diagnostic":"检查事件、选择和终态。","hints":["查看 #project-learning-assistant-v31。","不保存隐式思维链。"],"example":"mode/state/action/terminal/budget。","answer":"保存模式、状态事件、结构化选择、终态和预算；不保存隐式思维链。","source":{"label":"智能学习助手v0.31","href":"#project-learning-assistant-v31"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":false},
